[{"type": "subtitle", "time": 17650.55, "timestamp": "04:54:10", "text": "。如何提升你的內容？"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 17663.67, "timestamp": "04:54:23", "text": "例如，觀看自己的直播錄像，進行回顧，然後想：「嗯，我本來可以做得更好」等等。現在，把這些都寫下來。在以後的直播中也這麼做。下次直播時，努力"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 17666.59, "timestamp": "04:54:26", "text": "做得更好。"}, {"type": "chat", "time": 17669.873, "timestamp": "04:54:29", "author": "@Her_escapes", "avatar": "https://yt4.ggpht.com/k5qSeiW9HuWS-yTlvFtkJFgjFQNzT4clVmOKs1PPP76ezfBidoUedboWgIi3wJy0ffSGpxX2Gy8=s64-c-k-c0x00ffffff-no-rj", "message": "I'm learningUCkszU2WH9gy1mb0dV-11UJg/m8MfY4jbFsWJhL0PyouA2Ak"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 17685.948, "timestamp": "04:54:45", "text": "哦，我……我……我"}, {"type": "chat", "time": 17690.147, "timestamp": "04:54:50", "author": "@Shiori_mitsuki", "avatar": "https://yt4.ggpht.com/Dn0VbakjSKrSNaXx6PyhznuqbomoCGx22ivSawRcMXp25Io7cfsud3H3qP-g9QprPJUESlxxtJA=s64-c-k-c0x00ffffff-no-rj", "message": "Yess that’s what happening, this is bad i can’t really hangout w anyone. They will start rumours :) "}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 17691.11, "timestamp": "04:54:51", "text": "開了個關於這個、那個的玩笑。下次如果你覺得不好，就盡量避免。或者如果你犯了錯誤，例如…人肉搜尋自己，或是洩漏了什麼訊息，下次就不要使用螢幕錄製，或是更加小心。從錯誤中學習，不斷調整，這樣做會更好。與其"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 17699.59, "timestamp": "04:54:59", "text": "比較，不如想想“哦，我的一個YouTube朋友的觀眾比我"}]